{
  "name": "Aberrant Eidolon",
  "type": "ancestry",
  "effects": [],
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>Your eidolon is a terrifying, incomprehensible nightmare patterned after the creatures who owe their existence to the Outer Gods and Great Old Ones. Aberrant eidolons come in a variety of forms, though their anatomies often appear twisted and impossible. Most people can't even look at any aberrant eidolon without developing a splitting headache or having a panic attack, but your studies of the occult have inured your mind to these dread terrors.</p><p><strong>Tradition</strong> occult</p><p><strong>Traits</strong> aberration, eidolon</p><p><strong>Home Plane</strong> Dimension of Dreams or the Universe</p><p><strong>Size</strong> Medium or Small</p><p><strong>Suggested Attacks</strong> claw (slashing), jaws (piercing), tentacle (bludgeoning) Eidolon Attributes Con +2, Int +1, Wis +1, Cha –1</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Athletics, Occultism</p><p><strong>Senses</strong> darkvision</p><p><strong>Language</strong> Aklo</p><p><strong>Speed</strong> 25 feet</p><p><strong>Eidolon Abilities</strong> Initial @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.AC-Features.Item.FGge7DcAcsEtnI54]{Surprising Anatomy}; Symbiosis @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.AC-Features.Item.H4RnjjkG8DAxFdjU]{Unfathomable Mind}; Transcendence @UUID[Compendium.pf2e-animal-companions.AC-Features.Item.st4se4oYOF3DIs4K]{Maddening Whispers}</p>"
    },
